Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

WarehouseId={{warehouseId}}&IngredientId={{beefId}}&MaterialLotId={{lotHH.response.body.listData[qcStatus=DAT].id}}&Quantity=50&Reason=[DEMO] Tồn đầu kỳ (lô hết hạn)

###
POST {{base}}/api/ApprovalRequest/Decide
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Id={{adjHH.response.body.data.approvalRequestId}}&Approve=true&Note=[DEMO] duyệt tồn đầu kỳ

###
